# Template for src-tauri/.env, which is gitignored but must exist: tauri.conf.json
# lists it as a bundle resource, and main.rs loads it at runtime via dotenvy. A
# missing resource fails the bundler, which is the only reason the file is required.
#
# Every value below is optional. `pnpm setup:env` (and `pnpm tauri:dev`) creates the
# file from this template if it is absent; there is nothing to fill in for a working
# local build.
#
# The indexer used to need an INDEXER_API_KEY here. It authenticates the logged-in
# user now (src-tauri/src/api/indexer.rs), so there is no shared key to obtain — which
# also means a release build no longer carries one to be extracted from.

# Optional. Defaults to https://indexer.hippius.network (api/indexer.rs).
# HIPPIUS_INDEXER_URL=

# Optional. Points share links at a non-production console; the staging release
# workflow sets this to https://console.hippicode.com.
# HIPPIUS_CONSOLE_BASE_URL=
